  "$id": "https://neograph.dev/schemas/program-document-v3.schema.json",
  "title": "NeoGraph Program Document v3",
  "description": "Closed authored source contract for a finite typed Program operation tree. Cross-field requirements that JSON Schema cannot express portably are enforced by ProgramCompiler: root.name equals root.definition.name, every budget maximum is at least its minimum, all call_core nodes target the sealed root, direct await/spawn shape, bounded parallel_map item and concurrency limits, and finite static budget floors.",
